  "text": "Reset your password\n\nA password reset was requested for the Prismatica account user@example.com. Choose a new password here:\n\nhttps://localhost:4322/auth/reset#token_hash=abc&type=signup&sig=def\n\nThe link works once and expires in 24 hours. Asking for another link cancels this one.\nSetting a new password signs you out on every device.\n\nYou did not ask for this? Ignore this message; your password stays as it is.\n\nPrismatica - https://localhost:4322\n"
