  "text": "Your password was changed\n\nThe password of the Prismatica account user@example.com was changed on Saturday, 17 October 2026 at 10:00:00 UTC.\nEvery device that was signed in has been signed out. Sign in again with the new password:\n\nhttps://localhost:4322\n\nThis was not you? Open Prismatica, choose \"Forgot password\" in the sign-in window, and set a new password at once.\n\nThis is a security notice about your account; it is sent whatever your e-mail preferences.\n\nPrismatica - https://localhost:4322\n"
