  "text": "You already have an account\n\nSomeone, probably you, tried to create a Prismatica account for user@example.com. This address already has one, so nothing was created.\n\nSign in: https://localhost:4322\n\nForgot the password? Choose \"Forgot password\" in the sign-in window and we will send you a reset link.\n\nYou did not try to sign up? Ignore this message; your account has not changed.\n\nPrismatica - https://localhost:4322\n"
