id #1c1612; font-size:15px; line-height:1.45;\"><strong style=\"display:block; margin-bottom:4px; font-size:14px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.04em;\">IP address</strong>203.0.113.7</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0; padding:12px; border-bottom:1px solid #1c1612; font-size:15px; line-height:1.45;\"><strong style=\"display:block; margin-bottom:4px; font-size:14px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.04em;\">Location</strong>Local development or private network</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0; padding:12px; border-bottom:1px solid #1c1612; font-size:15px; line-height:1.45;\"><strong style=\"display:block; margin-bottom:4px; font-size:14px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.04em;\">How</strong>Failed password sign-in attempt through the Prismatica auth gateway</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0; padding:12px; border-bottom:1px solid #1c1612; font-size:15px; line-height:1.45;\"><strong style=\"display:block; margin-bottom:4px; font-size:14px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.04em;\">Where</strong>https://localhost:4322</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0; padding:12px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.45; word-break:break-word;\"><strong style=\"display:block; margin-bottom:4px; font-size:14px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.04em;\">Device</strong>Mozilla/5.0</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"border:2px dashed #1c1612; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; background:#f7f4ed;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.5;\"><strong>If this was you:</strong> no action is required.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.5;\"><strong>If this was not you:</strong> reset your password immediately and contact Prismatica support. This alert was sent to help you detect unauthorized access quickly.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:22px 0 8px 0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#4b4238;\">Request metadata: origin https://localhost:4322 \u00b7 referer not